l8589941392: 610 l8589941391 l8589934863 # Has value (l8589941391, "This is the Unicode U+0085. May semantically indicate a new paragraph. To indicate unambiguously a new line without a new paragraph, use 295 New line within paragraph. To indicate unambiguously a new paragraph, use 294 Paragraph separator.")
